  "verseCount": 24,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "4",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "ROM 4"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "4",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kūzunya kwa ng'wa Abulahamu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 4:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ali lūūlū, ū mu mhayo gwenūyū tūbūhaye kinehe ū būpandīki bo ng'wa Abulahamu, ū nkūlūgenji wise ū mu mīlī? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Abulahamu ūlū akabalīlwa būtūngīlīja kūlwa shītwa, numho alī nasho ī sha kūng'winha kwikumīlīja, gwike nahene ītī kū būtongi bo ng'wa Mulungu! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī shandīkwa shihayile ginehe ī gīsī? Tūhaya gīkī, “Ū Abulahamu akansanya Mulungu, hūna ūbalīlwa būtūngīlīja!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.4.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ī mheela īyo akinhagwa ntūmami ītabalagwa gīkī shilī shakwinhwa kūlwa shigongo, ī lyenīlo igasa; ū munhū ng'wenūyo shiigelile inhwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lelo ūyo atī ntūmami alīyo ūbiza ansanije dūhū ūyo akabalīlaga būtūngīlīja munhū nūūlū ng'hūnga, ū kūsanya kwakwe ū munhū ūyo alī gīko, kūkūbalwa kūbiza būtūngīlīja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.4.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gīt'ūmo na Daūdi alījihaya lubango ja ng'wa munhū wa kūbalīlwa būtūngīlīja na Mulungu mu būtūsendamīla shītwa; alīhaya gīkī,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.4.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 4:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.4.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 4:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī gīsī, ī lubango jenīji jilīho kūlwa basaalilwe dūhū, nūūlū na a babo batasaalilwe? Twamalaga kūhaya gīkī, “Ū kūsanya kwa ng'wa Abulahamu kūkabalwa kūbiza būtūngīlīja.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.4.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.4.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 4:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Īkaja ginehe nose kūūbalwa gīko? Ng'wikanza īlo amalile kūsaalwa, nūūlū aho ataalī kūsaalwa? Ītī ng'wikanza īlo amalile kūsaalwa, alīyo aho ataalī kūsaalwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.4.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 4:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho wasaalwa akanukūla lūmeng'ho lwa būtūngīlīja, kūlwa kūzunya ūko walī nako na a haho ataalī kūsaalwa. Ū mu gīko alī saabo na a babo bakūzunyaga nūūlū būbiza batasaalilwe; nabo bakūbalīlagwa būtūngīlīja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.4.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 4:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na a babo basaalilwe alī saabo, abo batagelelile ha kūsaalwa dūhū; alīyo bakashimīzīlaga nū mu kūzunya ūko sīswe Abulahamu walī nako na a haho ataalī kūsaalwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.4.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kwanukūla īyo twisagījiwa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 4:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.4.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 4:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū kwisagījiwa ūko akinhwa Abulahamu na Myalwa wakwe, gīkī akūbiza ng'wingīji wa sī, atinhilwe kūlwa kūdima shilagīlo, alīyo kūlwa būtūngīlīja bo mu kūzunya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.4.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.4.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 4:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nīyo ū wingīji ūlū būbiza bo banhū ba shilagīlo dūhū, ū kūzunya kūkūbiza kūtī na solobo, numho nū kwisagījiwa kūtī na ngofyoolo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.4.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.4.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 4:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno ī shilagīlo shikenhelejaga būpelanu, alīyo aho shitīho shilagīlo nū būhūbi būtīho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.4.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.4.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 4:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna lūūlū, ū kwisagījiwa kūtūūlilwe kūlwa būbyīle bose wa ng'wa Abulahamu, gīkī kūshikanyiwe kū bose mu nzīla ya shigongo; ītī kū banhū ba shilagīlo dūhū. Alīyo nū kū ba kūzunya kwa ng'wa Abulahamu, ūyo alī sīswe pye a bose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.4.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.4.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 4:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "H'ūmo gwandīkīlilwe; gīkī, “Naakūtūūlaga kūbiza ise wa mahanga mingī”. Ū Abulahamu alī gīko ū kū būtongi bo ng'wa Mulungu ūyo akansanya, ū Mulungu ūyo akabinhaga bafu būpanga, na kūshihaya shikolo nūūlū shitīho gītī shilīho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.4.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.4.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 4:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno nūūlū aho shalī shitīho sha kwisagīlwa, ū Abulahamu akazunya aho wisagījiwa gīkī akūbiza ise o mahanga mingī; gīt'ūmo gūhayiwe gīkī, “Ū būbyīle wako būkūbiza gīko.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.4.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.4.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 4:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atalelengetile ū mu kūzunya kwakwe, nūūlū īkī walī amanile gīkī ū mīlī gwakwe gwalī gūchile ng'wila, nguno walī na myaka hihī igana; hama walī amanile nī gīkī ī nda ya ng'wa Saala ī ya būbyīle yalī yamala kūcha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.4.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.4.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 4:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū kwisagīja kwa ng'wa Mulungu atakwiganikile mu mahane hane, alīyo ū kūzunya kūkanguzunhya, ūng'winha ikūjo ū Mulungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.4.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.4.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 4:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno walī amanile gīkī, ū Mulungu adūgije kūgwīta ūyo walī wang'wisagīja; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.4.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.4.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 4:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "h'ī nguno yene akabalīlwa būtūngīlīja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.4.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.4.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 4:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwike gūtandīkilwe gīkī akabalīlwa wei dūhū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.4.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.4.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 4:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo na a bise tūkūbalīlwa būtūngīlīja, a bise abo tūnzunije ūyo akanjūūcha Yesu Seeba wise kūfuma mu bafu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.4.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.4.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 4:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ūyo akabūlagwa kūlwa būhūbi wise, alīyo ūjūūchiwa gīkī tūbalīlwe būtūngīlīja.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.4.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.4.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
